title: Track oracle read refusal for dependency rows without timestamps
description: "During configured hierarchy differentials, the pinned 2026.10.14 oracle refused an item with several dependencies containing only id and kind: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading localeCompare). Supplying created_at on each dependency makes the real item readable. Keep valid timestamped fixture rows for this slice; independently reproduce and reassess after an oracle update. No upstream issue was filed."
